    <!-- Draw and Guess screen texts -->
    <string name="draw_guess_help_title">Draw and Guess</string>
    <string name="draw_guess_help_body">Take turns drawing a secret word while everyone else guesses.\n\nThe drawer picks one of three pictures, then presses and holds the button to see the word, and draws with a finger. Everyone else watches and taps their own name to buzz in. A buzzer gets one go: pick the matching picture card, or type the word. The clock stops while someone is guessing.\n\nA right guess scores for the guesser and the drawer, more the faster it comes. A wrong guess sits that player out for the turn.\n\nNo drawing skills needed: stick figures are fine! Drawing needs a finger on the screen, so players who cannot see it can guess from a description the drawer says aloud.</string>
